# Testing — {{ project_name }}

## Runner
- **Framework**: {{ testing }}

## Principles
- Test behavior users care about, not implementation trivia
- One assertion theme per test; descriptive names
- Prefer fixtures/factories over copy-pasted setup
- Do not add tests that only restate the obvious

## Before merge
- `{{ commands.test }}` passes
- New features include coverage for critical paths
- Flaky tests get fixed or quarantined — not ignored
